84:["$","p",null,{"className":"test-text","children":["“","My 6-year-old son was suffering from recurrent ear infections and glue ear. Dr. Dhirendra Singh Kushwah provided careful treatment and explained everything patiently. We particularly appreciated the clear communication and child-friendly approach.","”"]}]
